<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-13] ZEPPELIN_CONF_DIR cannot be reached until ZEPPELIN_CONF_DIR become set</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-13</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;bin/common.sh tries to find and set ZEPPELIN_CONF_DIR in order to read zeppelin-env.sh, but ZEPPELIN_CONF_DIR is defined in zeppelin-env.sh, so we cannot use different ZEPPELIN_CONF_DIR.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
