                            <comment id="14389854" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 1 Apr 2015 01:50:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user jongyoul opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/20&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/20&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-13&quot; title=&quot;ZEPPELIN_CONF_DIR cannot be reached until ZEPPELIN_CONF_DIR become set&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-13&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-13&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ZEPPELIN_CONF_DIR cannot be reached until ZEPPELIN_CONF_DIR become set&lt;/p&gt;

